{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:49f131deace66160d4bd45b8531e42ec479ab366aee9d11e39d632cc6aecc51c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:393385708899a65c14d7dd54d040c38b399b846754f1faec4eadeaaa9da8a5ba",
      "text": "喂，师父？抱歉这么突然。\n今天遇到了一点开心的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d41a4ee0e3d07eff03eb7365921eed414803c37da1fd999d5bbce6a3dab9ca5b",
      "text": "有个看了游击突袭演出的客人，\n专程来了一趟男道拉面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8bb64d19d25b8ff87a7c5b3a1d3aa2943c843197a28de7d89e9869a1ee18ef6",
      "text": "能来看演出就已经很开心了，\n没想到还特地来见我，真的太让我感动了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0209881b8c35958252d0ae3c76c1c8a4ed1999ea0faed87ab1d6b841381b2bc4",
      "text": "演出的力量真的很惊人呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98f42052c11ad4363adc42b7ea745857426b0cc821f49788b38ea15451f1bd21",
      "text": "这是道流先生自己的力量哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8eeec55d877d62e8dd9617b83573bfa822c27aa9dba84f8ee93356a3a2a389e",
      "text": "演出辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b124098c52df9e8d168b1a40881ec342c6dfb767be10df6082577273cb34a853",
      "text": "哪里，这也是多亏了各位工作人员以及一起演出的\n成员们共同努力的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a63f3852bff8344f51aa3fa52bf896fdd956b7fc6acbc65e77d99c4995a00354",
      "text": "嗯，再次道一声辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc541e43769ed258a10d57d0de4c4f765e4f5cbf588879cb0b3f45d9f9d12b24",
      "text": "对了对了，大家一开始果然都误以为是“爱憎拉面”，\n吓了好大一跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:528a6b837521d338d6ca2f39ef4e6ce298d4e6b4ee740189886954b42cd6e8b1",
      "text": "不过，后来和熟客们一起大笑着聊开了，\n大家看起来都很开心的样子，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_402_2_4_039_02_09_a:2_4_039_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d23f7b7653fc13d0e2e3476a76d7c536de5e4c4ab8d1d23ed8a5055f955d3053",
      "text": "我也变得越来越有干劲了。\n那明天事务所见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
